{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
I'm alone here on my [Am]island
Floating in the [F]sky, I’m
High above the [C]world I used to kno[G]w
And I'm far from any [Am]danger
Safe from any [F]failure
Guarded, I found [C]shelter in the stor[G]m
{end_of_verse}


{start_of_chorus}
I'm hiding in the [Am]blue[Em]
[C]Safe between the [D]clouds
In the [Am]blue[Em]
[C]Where I can’t be [D]found
{end_of_chorus}


{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Was a soldier in the [Am]legion
Fought against the [F]demons
Fought against the [C]monsters made of go[G]ld
But they stormed across [Am]Arcadia
Following their n[F]ature
Washed away the [C]place I once called [G]home
{end_of_verse}


