{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
As time goes racing [Am]by, I'm wishing I could [F]be fine
But I'm still so [C]stuck on what used to be[G]
Made a prison out of [Am]my mind
Watch life as it [F]goes by
Battle scarred, my [C]own worst enemy[G]
{end_of_verse}


